>
> I think development version of ggplot2, the facetting system now
> creates a data frame that looks something like this:
>
>  PANEL ROW COL SCALE_X SCALE_Y vs cyl
> 1     1   1   1       1       1  0   4
> 2     2   2   1       1       1  1   4
> 3     3   1   2       1       2  0   6
> 4     4   2   2       1       2  1   6
> 5     5   1   3       1       3  0   8
> 6     6   2   3       1       3  1   8
